# Settings for the paid runs, scripts/real_run.py. Nothing else reads them:
# the suite, the offline demo and every checker run without a key.
#
# real_run.py loads the file ENV_FILE names. A variable already set in the
# environment wins over the file. Keep that file outside every repository
# (e.g. ~/.secrets/ai.env, chmod 600):
#     ENV_FILE=~/.secrets/ai.env python scripts/real_run.py
# If you copy this template to .env inside the repository instead, point
# ENV_FILE at it; .env is ignored by git. Never commit it.

# Required only for the matching vendor (--vendor anthropic, the default, or
# --vendor openai):
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
